{
  "assumptions": [
    "Profile caepipe-mbf-import-1: MBF version 15.10, unit mode SI: lengths in mm, forces in N, moments in N*m, E in MPa (N/mm2), temperatures in degC; angles in deg; Y vertical; quantities keep their MBF unit.",
    "Node positions are summed from the printed offsets as exact rationals and rounded to binary64 once per node.",
    "Weight density in kgf/m3 becomes weight per length w = -rho * 9.80665 * A in N/m along global -Y (1 kgf = 9.80665 N), A the bare-metal area pi/4 (OD^2 - ID^2); weight acts on bare metal only.",
    "G is derived as E/(2(1+nu)) with E in Pa; materials are temperature-independent (identical E and expansion coefficient on every temperature line).",
    "Thermal change per element is T1 - T_ref (OPTEMP); zero changes give no primitive. Section corrosion, mill tolerance, insulation and lining fields given as zero are written as absent.",
    "The load reference L= is carried until changed, as M and P are; basis: profile decision PD-1 for MBF version 15.10 (TBD-17-04-007 stays open).",
